# Normalize line endings to LF everywhere.
#
# The Deno toolchain (deno fmt / lint / check) emits and expects LF, and CI
# runs on Linux, so CRLF in the working tree only produces spurious diffs and
# fmt --check failures on Windows checkouts. Text files are always stored and
# checked out as LF; binary files are auto-detected and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
